abstract = {In this paper, a verification platform for functional verification of anti-invasion and danger proximity alarm system of mining tunneling equipment is developed. The platform includes a multi-directional personnel radial intrusion simulation platform and a personnel circumferential surrounding simulation platform. At the same time, three different attitude software dummy with Chinese human body shape characteristics and Chinese human body infrared and radar reflection characteristics were developed. The platform can verify the key indicators such as personnel posture recognition, alarm boundary accuracy and alarm real-time performance of the anti-invasion and danger proximity alarm system of the tunneling equipment.},
